四、CaptureScene.tsx在scene.add(sky)之后加入以下钩子。它在资产到达后准备材质，保留既有回调，不改变普通校园对象。要求当前Three版本实际支持alphaHash；不支持时应拒绝该候选，而不是静默退回整片不透明。
```tsx
const previousBeforeRender = scene.onBeforeRender;
scene.onBeforeRender = (...args) => {
  previousBeforeRender.apply(scene, args);
  scene.traverse(object => {
    if (!(object instanceof THREE.Mesh) || !object.userData.coverage_alpha || object.userData.coveragePrepared) return;
    const materials = Array.isArray(object.material) ? object.material : [object.material];
    if (object.geometry.getAttribute('color')?.itemSize !== 4) throw new Error('Coverage requires COLOR_0 alpha');
    for (const raw of materials) {
      const m = raw as THREE.MeshStandardMaterial;
      if (typeof m.alphaHash !== 'boolean') throw new Error('alphaHash unavailable');
      m.vertexColors = true; m.transparent = false; m.alphaHash = true;
      m.alphaTest = 0; m.alphaToCoverage = false; m.depthWrite = true; m.needsUpdate = true;
    }
    object.userData.coveragePrepared = true;
  });
};
```
alphaHash避免依赖整对象透明排序，但自身可能引入颗粒和时间噪声；这里不把它或现有MSAA当成已验证的亚像素修复。GLB导出后必须检查COLOR_0 alpha与模块权重一致、材质alpha因子为1，且没有第二次alpha相乘。

